[[File:Bongo.jpg|thumb|right|275px|A Gungan submarine]]
'''Submarines''', alternatively known as '''submersibles''', were vehicles designed to operate [[Water|underwater]],<ref name="SW EOSAOV (SE)">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia of Starfighters and Other Vehicles (second edition)]]''</ref> and for underwater travel. They were utilised by certain [[species]], such as the [[Gungan]]s<ref name="DB">{{Databank|gungan-bongo-submarine|Gungan Bongo Submarine}}</ref> and the [[Draedan]]s.<ref name="MT">''[[Moving Target: A Princess Leia Adventure]]''</ref> There were several submarine models, such as the [[Tribubble bongo|Gungan bongo submarine]]<ref name="DB" /> or the [[heyblibber]].<ref name="EncyNass">{{SWE|characters|bossnass|Boss Nass}}</ref> The ''[[Daggadol]]'' was a submersible vehicle utilized by the Draedan [[pirate]]s of [[Captain]] [[Aurelant]].<ref name="MT" /> The [[Mon Cala planetary defense services]] utilized the [[One Man Submersible Devilfish]] submarine in it's forces.<ref name="Water War">{{TCW|Water War}}</ref>

